
## Standard Naming Convention

All assets copied into the master library follow this standard naming convention:

`cb-[category]-[description]-[orientation]-[variant]-v[number].[ext]`

Examples:
- `cb-background-navy-haze-landscape-v01.png`
- `cb-logo-shield-gold-transparent-v01.png`
- `cb-product-incident-form-description-closeup-v01.png`

